    "description": "Ryan Routh found guilty in Trump golf course assassination attempt",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.adaderana.lk/news/112843/ryan-routh-found-guilty-in-trump-golf-course-assassination-attempt",
    "lang": "en",
    "newspaper_id": "adaderanalk",
