    "description": "Sagara Kariyawasam issues stern warning to ex-MP Thisakutti Arachchi",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.adaderana.lk/news/112850/sagara-kariyawasam-issues-stern-warning-to-ex-mp-thisakutti-arachchi",
    "lang": "en",
