    "description": "Is cryptocurrency legal in Sri Lanka? Central Bank Governor explains",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.adaderana.lk/news/112860/is-cryptocurrency-legal-in-sri-lanka-central-bank-governor-explains",
    "lang": "en",
    "newspaper_id": "adaderanalk",
