    "description": "Japan PM says Palestine state recognition \u2018when not if\u2019",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.adaderana.lk/news/112865/japan-pm-says-palestine-state-recognition-when-not-if",
    "lang": "en",
    "newspaper_id": "adaderanalk",
