    "description": "NTB to acquire HSBC Sri Lanka\u2019s retail banking business for Rs. 18 billion",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.adaderana.lk/news/112867/ntb-to-acquire-hsbc-sri-lankas-retail-banking-business-for-rs-18-billion",
    "lang": "en",
