    "chunk_text": "Increasingly, maritime trade journeys are longer - increasing from an average haul of 4,831 miles in 2018 to 5,245 miles in 2024 - reflecting changes in trade routes and geopolitics, UNCTAD said.\n\n\u201cDistance is no longer geography; it is geoeconomics,\u201d Grynspan said."
