    "description": "IIT Madras Pravartak Technologies Foundation forges technology, entrepreneurship ties with Sri Lanka",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.ft.lk/business/IIT-Madras-Pravartak-Technologies-Foundation-forges-technology-entrepreneurship-ties-with-Sri-Lanka/34-782164",
    "lang": "en",
