    "description": "President Anura Kumara to meet UN Secretary-General tonight",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.adaderana.lk/news/112921/president-anura-kumara-to-meet-un-secretary-general-tonight-",
    "lang": "en",
    "newspaper_id": "adaderanalk",
