    "description": "Fitch assigns Hayleys Fentons first-time national rating of \u2018A+(lka)\u2019; outlook stable",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.ft.lk/business/Fitch-assigns-Hayleys-Fentons-first-time-national-rating-of-A-lka-outlook-stable/34-782195",
