    "description": "Chinese Ambassador reaffirms commitment to strengthening ties with Sri Lanka",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.adaderana.lk/news/112940/chinese-ambassador-reaffirms-commitment-to-strengthening-ties-with-sri-lanka",
    "lang": "en",
    "newspaper_id": "adaderanalk",
