    "description": "Shutting down the internet shuts down your right to know",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.ft.lk/opinion/Shutting-down-the-internet-shuts-down-your-right-to-know/14-782241",
    "lang": "en",
    "newspaper_id": "dailyftlk",
