    "description": "In Defence Of The Diaspora: Why Sri Lanka Should Embrace Expat Voting",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.colombotelegraph.com/index.php/in-defence-of-the-diaspora-why-sri-lanka-should-embrace-expat-voting/",
    "lang": "en",
