    "description": "Abans Group Director Dr. Saroshi Dubash honoured with \u2018Sri Lanka Woman Leader\u2019 at World Women Leadership Congress & Awards",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.ft.lk/business/Abans-Group-Director-Dr-Saroshi-Dubash-honoured-with-Sri-Lanka-Woman-Leader-at-World-Women-Leadership-Congress-Awards/34-782308",
