    "description": "New era for island of gems as countdown begins to \u2018FACETS Sri Lanka 2026\u2019",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.ft.lk/business/New-era-for-island-of-gems-as-countdown-begins-to-FACETS-Sri-Lanka-2026/34-782310",
    "lang": "en",
