    "description": "Better the known devil? Some thoughts on the politicisation of education",
    "url_metadata": "http://island.lk/better-the-known-devil-some-thoughts-on-the-politicisation-of-education/",
    "lang": "en",
    "newspaper_id": "islandlk",
