    "description": "President invites Japanese business community to explore Sri Lanka\u2019s emerging economic opportunities",
    "url_metadata": "http://island.lk/president-invites-japanese-business-community-to-explore-sri-lankas-emerging-economic-opportunities/",
    "lang": "en",
