    "description": "American Chamber  of Commerce  in Sri Lanka appoints Sandun Hapugoda as President at 33rd AGM",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.ft.lk/business/American-Chamber-of-Commerce-in-Sri-Lanka-appoints-Sandun-Hapugoda-as-President-at-33rd-AGM/34-782412",
