    "chunk_text": "Sri Lanka president meets Japanese emperor\n\nECONOMYNEXT \u2013 Sri Lanka\u2019s president Anura Disanayake has met Japan\u2019s Emperor Naruhito at the Imperial Palace, his media division said.\n\n\u201cIt was a great honour to be received at the Imperial Palace yesterday (30) for a warm and cordial discussion with His Majesty Emperor Naruhito of Japan,\u201d Disanayake said on social media.\n\n\u201cA deeply valued moment that underscores the longstanding friendship between our two nations.\u201d\n\nThe two leaders engaged in \u201ca cordial discussion\u201d, the PMD said.\n\nMinister of Foreign Affairs Vijitha Herath was also present. (Colombo/Oct1/2025)"
