    "chunk_text": "Automobile Association attends AUTOFORGE \u201825\n\nThe Automobile Association of Royal College conducted AUTOFORGE\u2019 25, an exhibition, on September 30, at the Royal College MAS Arena from 8.00am to 6.00pm.\n\nThis is a phase II Interactive exhibition of automotive excellence. This event featured cutting edge engineering innovations, pioneering designs and inspiring insights into the future of mobility. Several stakeholders displayed their products and merchandise Items at the exhibition.\n\nIt was a colourful and educative exhibition, especially for the upcoming younger generation.\n\nAthula Wijewardana \u2013 Principal of Royal College graced the occasion.\n\nAutomobile Association of Ceylon (AAC) was represented by Prasanna De Zoysa \u2013 Member of the EXCO & Sectional Chairman Road Safety & Environmental Management and Devapriya Hettiarachchi \u2013 Secretary. They were Guests of Honour at the event.\n\nThe Overseas School of Colombo strikes Gold again at the International ARC Awards in New York\n\nLeave a Reply Cancel replyYour email address will not be published. Required fields are marked *Comment * Name *\n\nSave my name, email, and website in this browser for the next time I comment."
