    "description": "Anura, Mahinda, Premadasa: Who is progressive, who isn\u2019t and why?",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.ft.lk/columns/Anura-Mahinda-Premadasa-Who-is-progressive-who-isn-t-and-why/4-782473",
