    "description": "\u2018US sanctions preventing Russia and Sri Lanka from getting the best out of bilateral trade links\u2019",
    "url_metadata": "http://island.lk/us-sanctions-preventing-russia-and-sri-lanka-from-getting-the-best-out-of-bilateral-trade-links/",
    "lang": "en",
