    "chunk_text": "The Yahapalana government consisted of the UNP and the SLFP\u2014two parties with criminal records. The SLPP is an off-shoot of the SLFP, led by the Rajapaksas, but its government could not flex its underworld muscles because it ruined the economy, causing its leaders to head for the hills, with irate people in close pursuit. The incumbent government is led by the JVP, which committed many crimes, such as murders including political assassinations, armed robberies and arson attacks on public property. One of its hitmen, Lionel Ranasinghe, arrested by the CID confessed to as many as 41 murders including the assassination of Vijaya Kumaratunga during the JVP\u2019s second uprising. His shocking confession has been reproduced verbatim in Dharman Wickremeratne\u2019s book, Comrade Lionel. He was killed by his captors.\n\nCrimes must be investigated in a credible and fair manner. Political leaders should leave such probes to the police without making political statements thereon. The police ought to refrain from acting in such a way that they are seen to be at the beck and call of the ruling party politicians. Worryingly, the current government leaders and some senior police officers give ball-by-ball commentaries, as it were, on ongoing criminal investigations, and their political statements undermine the integrity of those vital probes.\n\nLeave a Reply Cancel replyYour email address will not be published. Required fields are marked *Comment * Name *\n\nSave my name, email, and website in this browser for the next time I comment."
