    "chunk_text": "Luxury retirement living in Negombo by Grand Leisure Care\n\nSri Lanka\u2019s premier luxury aged care facility, Grand Leisure Care & Wellness Resort, (www.grandleisure.lk) is now open in Negombo, offering seniors a unique blend of comfort, professional care, and resort-style living. To celebrate its grand opening, the resort is offering an exclusive 40% discount for new residents.\n\nDesigned for golden years with dignity and peace, the resort provides 24/7 medical attention, personalized wellness programs, physiotherapy, and rehabilitation services in a safe, supportive, and luxurious environment. Families can ensure their loved ones enjoy a vibrant lifestyle, whether for short-term stays or long-term retirement living. The resort combines hotel-style luxury with international-standard elder care, featuring spacious rooms, delicious meals, a swimming pool, landscaped gardens, and leisure facilities. Full-board packages with meals start at just Rs. 110,000 (approx. USD 360) per month, far more affordable than overseas facilities. Daily rates are also available. When relatives visit from abroad, they too can stay at the resort as hotel guests, enjoying high-quality facilities. Offering direct admissions for short-term or long-term stays, Grand Care & Wellness provides a safe, supportive, and luxurious environment, complete with family-friendly amenities and professional care.\n\nKey fintech forum aims to foster collaboration between banks and technology companies\n\nLeave a Reply Cancel replyYour email address will not be published. Required fields are marked *Comment * Name *\n\nSave my name, email, and website in this browser for the next time I comment."
